    "en": "Set off on a delightful expedition and use your photographic eye to uncover the mysteries of the magical TOEM in this hand-drawn adventure game. Chat with quirky characters , solve their problems by snapping neat photos, and make your way through a relaxing landscape! Take photos with your camera to solve puzzles and help people! Listen to chill beats and take in your surroundings! Meet quirky characters and help them with their problems!"
  },
